class_name WeaponRowsV3
extends RefCounted
## The roster of wave 113 as plain rows: [id, NAME, TAG, family, {overrides of the family template}]. WeaponDefsV3 expands every row into a full def (template numbers, damage worked out from `power`,
## recoil pattern, sounds, price from the tier) and fills the tables of WeaponDefs (docs: godot/ARCHITECTURE.md, "Weapon roster v3").
## Row keys that are NOT def keys: power (sustained damage per second relative to the RIFT CARBINE, the damage is worked out from it), acc (share of rounds that land, BalanceModel.ACC), crit_k (head multiplier),
## tier (1..6: price and where it can be found), col (tracer colour name), alt ([preset, {overrides}]: the second fire mode), pat (recoil pattern name), drop (enemy types that carry it).
## Mechanic keys read by WeaponMech (scripts/player/weapon_mech.gd): opener, final, ramp / ramp_max, knock, slow / slow_k, mark / mark_time, zap / zap_time / zap_chain, chill / chill_max / freeze_time,
## dissolve / dissolve_time, ricochet / ricochet_k, pierce_n / pierce_k, sunder, p_heal, p_refund, p_hot, steady, crit_blast / crit_blast_dmg, pull, chaos, cone / cone_range, mist, zoom_alt, scope.
## Keys the older code already reads: burst, burst_gap, spin_up, spin_ready, heat_per, heat_cool, heat_lock, charge_time, min_charge, wall, wall_k, stun, burn, burn_time, chain, chain_range, chain_k, silent,
## splash*, twin, flame, pierce_shield, reach, cone, combo, combo_window, stagger (AimAssist).
## No real brand, model name or trademark appears in a name (tests/test_weapons_v3.gd checks the blocklist of tests/test_weapon_roster.gd).

